# file exists to close.
/wpbl/schedule   /  200
/wpbl/standings  /  200
/wpbl/stats      /  200
/wpbl/teams      /  200
# ONE LINE PER CLUB, AND DELIBERATELY NOT A WILDCARD. The two wildcards below exist because a
# player slug and a game slug live in the database and cannot be enumerated here; a club slug
# can, because there are four of them. Written out, an unknown /wpbl/teams/<anything> matches
# nothing and falls through to the real 404 with no edge-function check standing behind it,
# which is the arrangement this file prefers everywhere it is possible. A fifth club means a
# line here, exactly like a sixth tab does, and routes.test.ts fails until it is added.
